# oracle: cut-down examples/rdf-adf/in.spce.hbond: SPC/E liquid water (the first 333 of the 1500 molecules of the 4500-atom data, w41hb_spce_cut.data: 999 atoms in the same box, so the water is at a third of the example's density; pppm, flexible bonds, nvt; SHAKE is left out: see the note below), 25 steps instead of 50 (the cost is the 12 A pair cut-off on every atom: the 1500-molecule box took 14 s); hydrogen bonds with dist hdist angle ehb, reductions and ave/histo of the local columns
# oracle: the tolerance is 1e-6: the smallest H-bond angles (the c_rn[3] column) are sensitive to the last digits of the trajectory (the 50-step, 4500-atom run measured 1.5e-7 relative at step 50; this cut run measures 2.8e-12 at step 25)
# oracle-inputs: w41hb_spce_cut.data
# oracle-files: w41hb_spce_dist.histo w41hb_spce_angle.histo
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-6 abs=1e-9
units           real
atom_style      full
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 12.0 12.0
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
read_data       w41hb_spce_cut.data
pair_coeff      * * 0.0     1.0
pair_coeff      1 1 0.15535 3.166
pair_modify     tail yes
kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-6
# the G vector is fixed: the automatic choice (native 0.27965195) is not reproduced to the last digits on this box, and the hbond energies are real-space only
kspace_modify   gewald 0.27965195 mesh 40 40 40
dihedral_style  none
improper_style  none
bond_coeff      1 1000.00 1.000
angle_coeff     1 100.0 109.47
neighbor        2.0 bin
timestep        0.5
# neighbour lists are rebuilt every step: with the example's "every 1 delay 2 check yes" native's hbond count at step 10 is not reproduced (see the neighbour-list policy note in src/engine/compute/hbond_local.ts)
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check no
# SHAKE is left out: the engine's setup-time coordinate correction for fix shake differs from native by ~1e-6 Angstrom on this data file, which the hbond rows would expose
fix             2 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
thermo          10
group           ogroup type 1
group           hgroup type 2
variable        nmol equal count(ogroup)
compute         hb all hbond/local 3.3 30.0 ogroup ogroup hgroup dist hdist angle ehb
compute         rs all reduce sum c_hb[4] c_hb[5] c_hb[6] c_hb[7] inputs local
compute         rx all reduce max c_hb[4] c_hb[5] c_hb[6] c_hb[7] inputs local
compute         rn all reduce min c_hb[4] c_hb[5] c_hb[6] c_hb[7] inputs local
fix             dh all ave/histo 1 1 1 2.3 3.3 30 c_hb[4] mode vector kind local file w41hb_spce_dist.histo
fix             ah all ave/histo 1 1 1 0.0 30.0 30 c_hb[6] mode vector kind local file w41hb_spce_angle.histo
thermo_style    custom step temp pe c_hb c_rs[1] c_rs[2] c_rs[3] c_rs[4] c_rx[1] c_rx[2] c_rx[3] c_rx[4] c_rn[1] c_rn[2] c_rn[3] c_rn[4] v_nmol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
velocity        all create 300.0 6244325
run             25
